                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This budget fails to meet the real priorities of my constituents and the people of the San Joaquin Valley. \n\nI do not support shutting down the government, but I will not stand by and allow my constituents to face higher health care costs or see their care stripped away. \n\nDemocrats put forth a compromise proposal that keeps the government open and permanently locks in lower healthcare costs through the Affordable Care Act (ACA).\n\nWe owe it to the Valley and to the nation to deliver a budget that truly puts people first.",
