                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Expanded access to medical care is crucial for Valley families to receive the treatment and support they deserve. That\u2019s why I was proud to celebrate the opening of Kaiser Permanente\u2019s new Orchard Plaza Medical Offices. \n\nThis vital facility expands care, improves health outcomes, and creates good-paying jobs while strengthening our community!",
