                "text": "In my district, nearly 22,000 people could lose their ACA coverage if these tax credits expire. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nWe must protect Americans\u2019 access to health care and strengthen our nation\u2019s healthcare system. https://t.co/3iRBL9q6yw",
