                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Families in CA-21 can\u2019t afford higher health care costs. If Republicans let critical tax credits expire, a family of four earning $64,000 could see their premiums rise by over $2,500 a year. \n\nWe need a bipartisan solution. It\u2019s time to come to the table and make healthcare affordable for all Americans.",
