                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "More than two weeks ago, Republicans shut down the government because they refused to come to the table and work with Democrats to lower health care costs.  \n\nToday, families in the Valley and across California will receive their 2026 premium rates, yet another financial burden placed on their shoulders.",
