                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are refusing to come to the table to extend critical ACA tax credits \u2013 forcing higher health care premiums on Valley families and Americans across the country. \n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m hosting my \u201cFighting for Affordable Care\u201d telephone town hall.  \n\n\ud83d\udcc6 Thursday, October 23rd, 2025  \n\u23f0 5PM PT / 8PM EST  \n\ud83d\udcde Dial in at 833-998-2637 or watch live at https://t.co/U6odnr3CWV \n\nJoin me to hear how I\u2019m fighting for you, get updates on the government shutdown, and ask your questions about affordable health care.",
