                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Today, on #HumanRightsDay, we recognize the work of human rights defenders around the world, fighting for a better world where individual freedoms for all are respected.  \n\nThe Administration halted critical support for refugees, democracy, and global health programs \u2013 leaving communities without food, medical care, or lifesaving care. These programs are a source of U.S. \u201csmart power\u201d, projecting American values and instilling goodwill, advancing U.S. interests around the world.  \n\nDuring this uncertain time, we must restore our commitment to human dignity and accountability through our foreign and domestic policies.",
